      "observed_on": "2026-08-31",
      "source": "https://developers.openai.com/api/reference/resources/responses/methods/create",
      "facts": [
        "a non-streaming Responses API result is an HTTP JSON response whose top-level status can be completed",
        "final assistant content is represented by an output item of type message containing content of type output_text",
        "usage exposes input_tokens, output_tokens, and output_tokens_details.reasoning_tokens",
        "web_search_call action sources expose source URLs when requested but do not document requested URL, redirect chain, final fetch URL, or retrieval authentication context"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "gemini_interactions_response_2026_08_31",
      "provider": "Google Gemini",
      "observed_on": "2026-08-31",
      "source": "https://ai.google.dev/api/interactions-api-v1",
      "facts": [
        "the post-May-2026 Interactions API response has status, steps, and usage",
        "final model content is represented by a model_output step containing text content",
        "usage exposes total_input_tokens, total_output_tokens, total_thought_tokens, and modality token breakdowns",
        "google_search_result items expose title, URL, and snippet in result order but do not document requested URL, redirect chain, final fetch URL, or retrieval authentication context"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "groq_chat_response_2026_08_31",
